title Home Assistant: long names (cut with dots) and an area of 300 entities (60 dimmable lights with their slider rows), dragged
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO big

wait 1600
shot big-favourites
check big-favourites
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 1500
shot big-area
check big-area
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.25
wait 300
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.25
wait 300
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.25
wait 500
shot big-area-scrolled
check big-area-scrolled
expect noquit
